ed for GLM-5.2 model.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Hacker News</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">July 2, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"GLM-5.2 ranked first in Design Arena programming leaderboard\"</div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"I decided to uninstall Claude and Codex after trying ZCode\"</div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"82% cheaper than Claude Code on output tokens\"</div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Supports 1M context length, leading in long-horizon tasks\"</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">GLM-5.2</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">multi-agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">free tier</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section (35%) -->\n            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\" id=\"updates\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-header\">Product Updates</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">v3.11</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cursor Side Chats & Search</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"item-description\">\n                        Introducing Side Chats functionality, Conversation Search capability, new /automate skill, and triggers for workflow automation.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">release</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">July 10, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"This release makes it easier to stay in flow with side chats that run alongside your main chat\"<span class=\"quote-source\"> — Official Changelog</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Cursor 3.11 lets developers run parallel AI chats without stopping their agent\"<span class=\"quote-source\"> — AlphaSignal</span></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">NEW</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/label/copilot/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub Copilot GPT-5.6 Models</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"item-description\">\n                        OpenAI's GPT-5.6 models (Sol, Terra, and Luna) now available. Features Enterprise-managed OpenTelemetry, review cycles, Copilot CLI memory, and UI improvements.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">July 13, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"OpenAI's GPT-5.6 family is now rolling out with three variants: Sol (speed), Terra (balanced), and Luna (lowest cost).\"<span class=\"quote-source\"> — GitHub Blog</span></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">v0.144.1</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Codex CLI Installer Fixes</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"item-description\">\n                        Standalone installer fixes for GitHub metadata issues, code mode reliability improvements, enhanced GPT-5.6 Computer Use speed, and plugin management enhancements.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">bugfix</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">July 9, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote sentiment-negative\">\"Codex CLI gave incorrect code recommendations based on outdated info. Doesn't have access to internet.\"<span class=\"quote-source\"> — Reddit</span></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">v0.50.0</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Gemini CLI Plan Mode</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"item-description\">\n                        New Plan Mode forces AI to research before writing code. Includes /agents refresh, /skills reload commands, safer auto-updates, and improved terminal handling.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">release</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">July 8, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote sentiment-positive\">\"Plan Mode is the one Gemini CLI feature I wish I used earlier. It adds time upfront but saves you from cleaning up bad changes later.\"<span class=\"quote-source\"> — Reddit</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"quote sentiment-negative\">\"Genuine question - how is Gemini CLI still so far behind? Miles behind Claude and Codex CLIs.\"<span class=\"quote-source\"> — Reddit</span></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.26-30</span>\n                        <a href=\"https:/