    "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Agentic Coding Research Report - 2026-07-14</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 0 10px;\n        }\n\n        header {\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            padding: 10px 0;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n\n        header h1 {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 18px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        header .date {\n            font-size: 12px;\n            color: #000000;\n            margin-top: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .three-column-layout {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 40% 35% 25%;\n            gap: 20px;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .column {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            padding: 15px;\n            min-height: 400px;\n        }\n\n        .column h2 {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            padding-bottom: 10px;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #ff6600;\n        }\n\n        .item {\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            padding-bottom: 15px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;\n        }\n\n        .item:last-child {\n            border-bottom: none;\n        }\n\n        .item-title {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a {\n            color: #000000;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:visited {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .item-description {\n            color: #000000;\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n            line-height: 1.5;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta {\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta a {\n            color: #828282;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta a:hover {\n            color: #ff6600;\n        }\n\n        .tag {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #f0f0f0;\n            color: #828282;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin: 2px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        .community-quotes {\n            margin-top: 10px;\n            padding: 8px;\n            background-color: #f9f9f9;\n            border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;\n        }\n\n        .quote {\n            font-style: italic;\n            color: #555555;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n            font-size: 11px;\n        }\n\n        .quote-source {\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .quote.negative {\n            color: #8b0000;\n        }\n\n        .quote.positive {\n            color: #006400;\n        }\n\n        .sentiment-positive {\n            color: #006400;\n        }\n\n        .sentiment-negative {\n            color: #8b0000;\n        }\n\n        .sentiment-neutral {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        footer {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 20px;\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            margin-top: 40px;\n        }\n\n        footer a {\n            color: #828282;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        footer a:hover {\n            color: #ff6600;\n        }\n\n        .empty-state {\n            color: #828282;\n            font-style: italic;\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 40px;\n        }\n\n        .update-type {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin-right: 5px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.release {\n            background-color: #e6f7ff;\n            color: #0050b3;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.feature {\n            background-color: #f6ffed;\n            color: #389e0d;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.bugfix {\n            background-color: #fff2e8;\n            color: #d46b08;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.announcement {\n            background-color: #f0f0f0;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        @media print {\n            body {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n            }\n\n            .column {\n                border: none;\n                page-break-inside: avoid;\n            }\n\n            header {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n                border-bottom: 2px solid #ff6600;\n            }\n\n            header h1 {\n                color: #000000;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Agentic Coding Research Report</h1>\n            <div class=\"date\">July 14, 2026</div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <main class=\"three-column-layout\">\n            <!-- New Products Section (40%) -->\n            <section class=\"new-products\">\n                <div class=\"column\">\n                    <h2>New Products</h2>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://zcode.z.ai/en\" target=\"_blank\">ZCode</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            AI-powered Agentic Development Environment (ADE) combining AI agents with existing toolchains for planning, coding, review, and deployment. Deeply optimized for GLM-5.2 model with multi-agent collaboration capabilities.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type release\">Released</span>\n                            <span>2026-07-02</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI IDE</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">GLM-5.2</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"community-quotes\">\n                            <div class=\"quote positive\">\"GLM-5.2 ranked first in Design Arena programming leaderboard\"</div>\n                            <div class=\"quote positive\">\"82% cheaper than Claude Code on output tokens\"</div>\n                            <div class=\"quote\">\"Supports 1M context length, leading in long-horizon tasks\"</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section (35%) -->\n            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\">\n                <div class=\"column\">\n                    <h2>Product Updates</h2>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/whats-new\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Code</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Claude Sonnet 5 became new default model featuring top-tier coding capabilities. Versions 2.1.26-2.1.30 included 6 new features, 7 improvements, and 12 bug fixes with lower memory usage.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                            <span>2026-07-01</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"community-quotes\">\n                            <div class=\"quote negative\">\"Seems like the model is incredibly inefficient at max reasoning\"</div>\n                            <div class=\"quote negative\">\"Sonnet 5.0 basically refuses to do any work\"</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini CLI</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Version 0.50.0 introducing Plan Mode feature that forces AI to research before writing code, new commands, safer auto-updates mechanism, and improved terminal handling.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                            <span>2026-07-08</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"community-quotes\">\n                            <div class=\"quote positive\">\"Plan Mode saves you from cleaning up bad changes later\"</div>\n                            <div class=\"quote negative\">\"Gemini CLI was already losing and it's now being replaced\"</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/releases\" target=\"_blank\">Codex CLI</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Version 0.144.1 focusing on standalone installer fixes and code mode reliability improvements. Enhanced GPT-5.6 Computer Use speed and plugin management.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type bugfix\">Bug Fix</span>\n                            <span>2026-07-09</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Version 3.11 introducing Side Chats functionality, Conversation Search capability, new /automate skill, and new triggers for improved workflow automation.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                            <span>2026-07-10</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"community-quotes\">\n                            <div class=\"quote positive\">\"Makes it easier to stay in flow with side chats\"</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/label/copilot/\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Copilot</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            OpenAI's GPT-5.6 models (Sol, Terra, and Luna) now available. Features Enterprise-managed OpenTelemetry, review cycles and time tracking, Copilot CLI memory feature.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                            <span>2026-07-13</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"community-quotes\">\n                            <div class=\"quote positive\">\"GPT-5.6's reasoning tiers populate nearly the whole useful frontier\"</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/overview\" target=\"_blank\">Devin</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Devin Review for GitLab, MCP marketplace expansion with 48+ connectors, personal automations, improved Slack integration, and enhanced security features.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                            <span>2026-07-31</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://codeium.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Windsurf</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            No major updates in July 2026. Latest major version was v1.5.9 from March 2025 featuring Gemini 2.5 Pro beta.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type announcement\">Info</span>\n                            <span>2026-07-14</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://aider.chat/HISTORY.html\" target=\"_blank\">Aider</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Continuous updates with support for Claude 4.5/4.6, Gemini 2.5/3 preview, DeepSeek Reasoner, and GPT-5.1/5.2 models. Enhanced reasoning effort settings.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                            <span>2026-07-14</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Section (25%) -->\n            <section class=\"technical-insights\">\n                <div class=\"column\">\n                    <h2>Technical Insights</h2>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48884984\" target=\"_blank\">Promptster: Engineers' AI Tool Usage</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Project analyzing engineers' work with AI coding tools including Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, and Copilot to understand usage patterns.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>HN Discussion</span>\n                            <span>2026-07-13</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://newrelic.com/resources/report/2026-state-of-ai-coding\" target=\"_blank\">2026 State of AI Coding Report</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            New Relic's comprehensive report on AI-generated code speeding development but complicating production environments.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>Industry Report</span>\n                            <span>2026-07-12</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pvMGRSZJ4Jw\" target=\"_blank\">Best AI Coding Tools for 2026</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Fireship's comprehensive guide for developers on AI-assisted development tools.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>YouTube Tutorial</span>\n                            <span>2026-07-11</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://codepick.dev/en/guides/ai-coding-agents-2026-roadmap/\" target=\"_blank\">AI Coding Agents: 2026 Roadmap</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Practical insights into implementing multi-agent systems, prompt engineering, and best practices for AI agents in development pipelines.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>Technical Blog</span>\n                            <span>2026-07-11</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://www.agensi.io/learn/best-ai-coding-tools-july-2026\" target=\"_blank\">Post-GPT-5.6 Tool Rankings</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Claude Code emerges as top choice, with Cursor at #2 IDE spot. OpenCode listed as most practical free option.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>Technical Analysis</span>\n                            <span>2026-07-10</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EV7WhVT270Q\" target=\"_blank\">State of AI in 2026</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Lex Fridman's 4.5-hour discussion on LLMs, AI coding, scaling laws, agents, GPUs, and AGI paths.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>Podcast</span>\n                            <span>2026-07-09</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://www.morphllm.com/best-ai-coding-agents-2026\" target=\"_blank\">Best AI Coding Agents Leaderboard</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Codex CLI on GPT-5.5 leads Terminal-Bench 2.1 at 83.4% accuracy. Detailed performance analysis across coding tasks.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>Benchmark Report</span>\n                            <span>2026-07-08</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net\" target=\"_blank\">Rewriting Bun in Rust Case Study</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            11-day rewrite using AI agents consumed $165,000 in tokens, demonstrating agentic engineering capabilities.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>Technical Blog</span>\n                            <span>2026-07-08</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net\" target=\"_blank\">AI-Written PR Descriptions Moratorium</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Kenton Varda's insight: AI writes worse descriptions by focusing on code details while omitting higher-level framing.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>Opinion</span>\n                            <span>2026-07-08</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47394022\" target=\"_blank\">How I Write Software with LLMs</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            HN discussion exploring style differences between LLM and human-generated code and practical workflows.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>HN Discussion</span>\n                            <span>2026-07-08</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net\" target=\"_blank\">sqlite-utils 4.0 with AI Assistance</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Simon Willison's 124th release introducing database migrations, heavily assisted by Claude Fable AI coding agent.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>Technical Blog</span>\n                            <span>2026-07-07</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer>\n            <p>Report generated by Agent Code Daily - Powered by Claude Agent SDK</p>\n            <p>\n                <a href=\"#\" onclick=\"window.print(); return false;\">Print Report</a> |\n                <a href=\"javascript:window.location.reload()\">Refresh</a>\n            </p>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
