    "originalFile": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Agentic Coding Research Report - 2026-07-14</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            color: #000000;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n\n        a {\n            color: #000000;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 0 10px;\n        }\n\n        header {\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            padding: 5px 10px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        header .container {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .logo {\n            font-weight: bold;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            color: #000000;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        .date {\n            color: #000000;\n            font-size: 12px;\n        }\n\n        .nav-bar {\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            padding: 8px 0;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        .nav-bar a {\n            color: #828282;\n            margin-right: 15px;\n            font-size: 12px;\n        }\n\n        .nav-bar a:hover {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        main {\n            padding: 15px 0;\n        }\n\n        .three-column-layout {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 40% 35% 25%;\n            gap: 15px;\n            align-items: start;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .technical-insights {\n                grid-column: 1 / -1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n        }\n\n        section {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            padding: 12px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        .section-header {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            padding-bottom: 8px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #ff6600;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .item {\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            padding-bottom: 12px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;\n        }\n\n        .item:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            padding-bottom: 0;\n            border-bottom: none;\n        }\n\n        .item-title {\n            font-size: 13px;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a {\n            color: #000000;\n            font-weight: normal;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:visited {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-description {\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta {\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #828282;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            gap: 8px;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .tag {\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .source-badge {\n            color: #ff6600;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            font-weight: normal;\n        }\n\n        .release-date {\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 11px;\n        }\n\n        .quote {\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            padding: 8px;\n            margin: 6px 0;\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #444444;\n            border-left: 2px solid #ff6600;\n        }\n\n        .quote-source {\n            font-size: 10px;\n            color: #828282;\n            margin-top: 4px;\n            font-style: normal;\n        }\n\n        .sentiment-positive {\n            color: #228822;\n        }\n\n        .sentiment-negative {\n            color: #cc2222;\n        }\n\n        .sentiment-neutral {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .topics {\n            margin-top: 6px;\n        }\n\n        .topic-tag {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #f0f0f0;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin: 2px 2px 2px 0;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            color: #666666;\n        }\n\n        .version-badge {\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            margin-right: 5px;\n        }\n\n        footer {\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            padding: 15px 0;\n            border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        footer a {\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            margin: 0 10px;\n        }\n\n        footer a:hover {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .footer-text {\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            margin-top: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .highlight-link {\n            color: #ff6600;\n            font-weight: normal;\n        }\n\n        .highlight-link:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .update-type {\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            font-size: 9px;\n            color: #828282;\n            letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n        }\n\n        @media print {\n            body {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n            }\n\n            section {\n                border: 1px solid #cccccc;\n                page-break-inside: avoid;\n            }\n\n            .three-column-layout {\n                display: block;\n            }\n\n            section {\n                margin-bottom: 20px;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"logo\">Agentic Coding Daily</a>\n            <span class=\"date\">July 14, 2026</span>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"nav-bar\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <a href=\"#new-products\">New Products</a>\n            <a href=\"#updates\">Updates</a>\n            <a href=\"#insights\">Insights</a>\n            <a href=\"#about\">About</a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <main class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"three-column-layout\">\n            <!-- New Products Section (40%) -->\n            <section class=\"new-products\" id=\"new-products\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-header\">New Products</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://zcode.z.ai/en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ZCode by Zhipu AI</a>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI IDE</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"item-description\">\n                        AI-powered Agentic Development Environment combining AI agents with existing toolchains for planning, coding, review, and deployment. Deeply optimized for GLM-5.2 model.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Hacker News</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">July 2, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"GLM-5.2 ranked first in Design Arena programming leaderboard\"</div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"I decided to uninstall Claude and Codex after trying ZCode\"</div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"82% cheaper than Claude Code on output tokens\"</div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Supports 1M context length, leading in long-horizon tasks\"</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">GLM-5.2</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">multi-agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">free tier</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section (35%) -->\n            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\" id=\"updates\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-header\">Product Updates</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">v3.11</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cursor Side Chats & Search</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"item-description\">\n                        Introducing Side Chats functionality, Conversation Search capability, new /automate skill, and triggers for workflow automation.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">release</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">July 10, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"This release makes it easier to stay in flow with side chats that run alongside your main chat\"<span class=\"quote-source\"> — Official Changelog</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Cursor 3.11 lets developers run parallel AI chats without stopping their agent\"<span class=\"quote-source\"> — AlphaSignal</span></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">NEW</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/label/copilot/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub Copilot GPT-5.6 Models</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"item-description\">\n                        OpenAI's GPT-5.6 models (Sol, Terra, and Luna) now available. Features Enterprise-managed OpenTelemetry, review cycles, Copilot CLI memory, and UI improvements.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">July 13, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"OpenAI's GPT-5.6 family is now rolling out with three variants: Sol (speed), Terra (balanced), and Luna (lowest cost).\"<span class=\"quote-source\"> — GitHub Blog</span></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">v0.144.1</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Codex CLI Installer Fixes</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"item-description\">\n                        Standalone installer fixes for GitHub metadata issues, code mode reliability improvements, enhanced GPT-5.6 Computer Use speed, and plugin management enhancements.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">bugfix</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">July 9, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote sentiment-negative\">\"Codex CLI gave incorrect code recommendations based on outdated info. Doesn't have access to internet.\"<span class=\"quote-source\"> — Reddit</span></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">v0.50.0</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Gemini CLI Plan Mode</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"item-description\">\n                        New Plan Mode forces AI to research before writing code. Includes /agents refresh, /skills reload commands, safer auto-updates, and improved terminal handling.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">release</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">July 8, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote sentiment-positive\">\"Plan Mode is the one Gemini CLI feature I wish I used earlier. It adds time upfront but saves you from cleaning up bad changes later.\"<span class=\"quote-source\"> — Reddit</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"quote sentiment-negative\">\"Genuine question - how is Gemini CLI still so far behind? Miles behind Claude and Codex CLIs.\"<span class=\"quote-source\"> — Reddit</span></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.26-30</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/whats-new\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude Sonnet 5 Default</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"item-description\">\n                        Claude Sonnet 5 became new default model with top-tier coding capabilities. 6 new features, 7 improvements, 12 bug fixes with lower memory usage and faster performance.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">release</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">July 1, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote sentiment-negative\">\"Seems like the model is incredibly inefficient at max reasoning, it uses far more tokens. Cost per task is shockingly high.\"<span class=\"quote-source\"> — HN</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"quote sentiment-negative\">\"Sonnet 5.0 basically refuses to do any work. Constantly disagreeing and constantly correcting me even if it has no idea what I'm talking about.\"<span class=\"quote-source\"> — Reddit</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"quote sentiment-positive\">\"Introducing Claude Sonnet 5, our most agentic Sonnet yet. It makes plans, uses tools like browsers and terminals, and runs autonomously.\"<span class=\"quote-source\"> — X</span></div>\n                </div>\n\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Section (25%) -->\n            <section class=\"technical-insights\" id=\"insights\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-header\">Technical Insights</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DTX0lYmEhwo/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Summer AI Developer Program</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"item-description\">\n                        Educational program July 13-24, 2026, addressing whether traditional coding skills remain relevant in era of AI assistants like ChatGPT, Copilot, and Cursor AI.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Educational Program</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">July 13, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">AI education</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">developer skills</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">future of coding</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://newrelic.com/resources/report/2026-state-of-ai-coding\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">2026 State of AI Coding Report</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"item-description\">\n                        New Relic's comprehensive report on AI-generated code speeding development but complicating production environments. Covers adoption rates, productivity, and best practices.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Industry Report</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">July 12, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">code quality</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">productivity</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">workflows</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://codepick.dev/en/guides/ai-coding-agents-2026-roadmap/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noo